    "title": "Odessa man dies after police use taser during welfare check - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Richards ,\n10 hours ago ODESSA, Texas — A man died after Odessa police used a taser on him during a welfare check, according to authorities. On June 2, 2026, at 6:48 p.m., the Odessa Police Department responded to a welfare check for a male subject in the 2400 block of Cambridge. The man, armed with a brick, evaded officers out of the residence. Officers caught up to him in the roadway and deployed a taser to gain custody, according to a press release from the department. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
